# Cloudflare Pages redirects: old WordPress URLs on pecowater.com -> new site.
# Seeded from docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md §6. Format: <from> <to> <status>
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Each old URL is listed with and without its trailing slash so both forms
# redirect in one hop. Targets end in "/" to match trailingSlash: 'always'.
# Most targets are built in Phase 2-3; until then they 404 on staging.
#
# Not redirected: "/" and "/services/" keep the same path on the new site.
#
# TODO before cutover (Phase 5):
